    "Converted body storage from array-of-structs to structure-of-arrays (SoA)",
    "Parallelized the per-body force loop with OpenMP static scheduling",
    "Manually unrolled the inner j-loop by a factor of 4 while preserving exact summation order",
    "Added restrict qualifiers to pointer parameters in body_force"
  ]
